{
  "$schema": "../../../../../schemas/model.schema.json",
  "_comment": [
    "TicketEvent (docs/commerce_PRD.md §4.11, D17): an organization-owned, publishable event (X8). Its dates, ticket types",
    "and sale phases are their own types. Publishing (IsPublished) needs the organization's Publish role (Admin) and is",
    "refused while the event cannot sell; it provisions every date (TicketEventInterceptor). Policy holds the per-sale",
    "values within the channel's bounds (D2).",
    "",
    "HAND-AUTHORED. Ids are UUIDv5 of 'ticketing-events:TicketEvent[...]', written by 'npm run stamp:library-model-ids'."
  ],
